<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
    Modern Standard Arabic. DRAFT: written alongside the English and not yet reviewed by a native
    speaker; have it reviewed before a release ships it.

    Every rule in values/strings.xml's header applies here too. Nothing grades a day: no target, no
    half day, no absence, and no word for a streak. "Habit" is عادة, never هدف (a goal is a target).
    "Check In" / "Check Out" are a fixed pair everywhere: تسجيل الحضور / تسجيل الانصراف. The product
    name Sleeves Up stays in Latin script and is not translated (app_name is translatable="false").

    Numbers are Latin digits in every language (see util/LatinDigits), so the %d slots below print
    0-9. Plurals carry all six Arabic quantities.
-->
